{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23997","headline":"六十拜河南尹 · 白居易","name":"六十拜河南尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六十河南尹，前途足可知。\n老应无处避，病不与人期。\n幸遇芳菲日，犹富强健时。\n万金何假藉，一醆莫推辞。\n流水光阴急，浮云富贵迟。\n人间若无酒，尽合鬓成丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}